#: linux/verso-service/src/commands.rs:467
#: linux/verso-linux/src/daemon.rs:506
msgid "Verso Drive is not mounted"
msgstr "Verso Drive 未挂载"

#: linux/verso-service/src/commands.rs:467
#: linux/verso-linux/src/daemon.rs:506
msgid "Switch it on in Verso's Preferences, then open the link again."
msgstr "请在 Verso 的首选项中开启驱动器，然后再次打开链接。"

#: linux/verso-service/src/online.rs:448
msgid "The keyring stayed locked. Open {app}, or run “{command}”, to try again."
msgstr "密钥环仍处于锁定状态。请打开 {app}，或运行“{command}”以重试。"

